<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8" />
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
        <title>You're invited to Glob</title>
    </head>

    <body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f3f1fb; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #3d3b4a">
        <div style="background-color: #f3f1fb; padding: 40px 16px">
            <div style="max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto">
                <div style="text-align: center; padding-bottom: 18px">
                    <span style="display: inline-block; background-color: #0c0c0d; color: #ffffff; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.5px; padding: 10px 22px; border-radius: 999px">glob</span>
                </div>

                <div style="background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 24px; padding: 40px 32px; box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(60, 40, 120, 0.08)">
                    <div style="height: 6px; width: 64px; margin: 0 auto 28px; border-radius: 999px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #cfc3fb, #bff0b6, #fadf6a)"></div>

                    <h1 style="margin: 0 0 14px; text-align: center; font-size: 28px; line-height: 1.25; letter-spacing: -0.6px; color: #0c0c0d">
                        We saved you a seat.
                    </h1>

                    <p style="margin: 0 0 18px; text-align: center; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; color: #55536a">
                        <% if (invitedBy) { %><strong style="color: #0c0c0d"><%= invitedBy %></strong> just invited you to join the team on <strong style="color: #0c0c0d">Glob</strong>.<% } else { %>You have been invited to join the team on <strong style="color: #0c0c0d">Glob</strong>.<% } %>
                    </p>

                    <p style="margin: 0 0 28px; text-align: center; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; color: #55536a">
                        It is where we share ideas, plan together, sketch on the same whiteboard, and talk it through, all in one calm place. We are really glad you are coming.
                    </p>

                    <div style="text-align: center; margin: 0 0 30px">
                        <a href="<%= appUrl %>" style="display: inline-block; background-color: #0c0c0d; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; padding: 15px 34px; border-radius: 999px">
                            Join the team
                        </a>
                    </div>

                    <div style="background-color: #f7f5fe; border-radius: 16px; padding: 18px 20px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; color: #55536a">
                        <strong style="color: #0c0c0d">How to get in</strong><br />
                        Open Glob and create your account with this email address (<strong style="color: #0c0c0d"><%= email %></strong>), or simply continue with Google. Any other email will not be able to sign in.
                    </div>
                </div>

                <p style="margin: 22px 0 0; text-align: center; font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.6; color: #8d8ba0">
                    If you were not expecting this, you can ignore this email.<br />
                    <a href="<%= appUrl %>" style="color: #8d8ba0"><%= appUrl %></a>
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </body>
</html>
